  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Neoadjuvant chemoradiotherapy for stage III, radical surgical treatment for stages I, II and III, combined surgery for stage IV (multiple primary tumors, tumor spread to adjacent organs, removal of synchronous and metachronous metastases), targeted therapy and immunotherapy."
