  * ^designation[=].value = "Anal canal polyp, uncomplicated course. Transanal polypectomy"
* #basis-0001-00985 "Anal kanal polipi, tushishi, qon ketish asoratlari, postgemorragik anemiya II-III darajalari, qo'shimcha yondosh kasalliklari. Transanal polipektomiya"
