  * ^designation[=].value = "For conservative and surgical treatment of children under 18"
* #basis-0001-01742 "18 yoshgacha bo‘lgan bolalarda kasallik asoratlarining qaytalanishi yoki ikkilamchi jarrohlik amaliyotini bajarish uchun"
