  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Post-traumatic arthrosis of other joints. Joint contractures in a non-functional position, articular surface erosions, severe joint dysfunction due to marked joint pain (for surgical treatment)"
* #basis-0001-01815 "Oyoq va qo‘llar orttirilgan deformatsiyalari. Qo‘l va oyoqlar faoliyatining yengil buzilishiga olib keluvchi deformatsiyalar, kuyish oqibatidagi chandiqli jarayon keltirib chiqargan kontrakturalar, bo‘g‘imlarning nuqsonli holda harakatsiz holga kelishi (operativ davo maqsadida). Tibbiy reabilitatsiya"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Приобретенные деформации стоп и кистей. Деформации, приводящие к незначительному нарушению активности рук и ног, контрактуры, вызванные рубцовым процессом вследствие ожогов, неподвижность суставов вследствие дефектов (с целью оперативного лечения). Медицинская реабилитация"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Acquired deformities of feet and hands. Deformities causing minor impairment of hand and foot function, contractures due to burn scarring, joint immobility due to defects (for surgical treatment). Medical rehabilitation"
* #basis-0001-01816 "Oyoq va qo‘llar orttirilgan deformatsiyalari. Qo‘l va oyoq faoliyatining keskin buzilishiga olib keluvchi orttirilgan deformatsiyalar. Bo‘g‘imlarning nuqsonli holda harakatsiz holga kelishi, oyoqlarning 5 sm va undan ortiq hajmda kaltaligi operativ davo"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Приобретенные деформации стоп и кистей. Приобретенные деформации, приводящие к выраженным нарушениям функции кисти и стопы. Иммобилизация суставов при дефектах, короткости ног 5 см и более, оперативное лечение."
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Acquired deformities of feet and hands. Acquired deformities causing marked impairment of hand and foot function. Joint immobility with defects, leg shortening of 5 cm or more, surgical treatment."
* #basis-0001-01817 "Oyoq va qo‘llar orttirilgan deformatsiyalari. Qo‘l va oyoq faoliyatining keskin buzilishiga olib keluvchi orttirilgan deformatsiyalar, bo‘g‘imlarning nuqsonli holda harakatsiz holga kelishi, oyoqlarning 5 sm va undan ortiq hajmda kaltaligi operativ davo"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
