  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Calcific tendinitis of the shoulder. Tendinitis of the long head of biceps. Shoulder pain, range of motion limited to 90°, intermittent pain discomfort."
* #basis-0001-01926 "Yelka bo‘g‘imi kalsifikatsiyalovchi tendinitlari. Yelka bo‘g‘imidagi og‘riqlarni harakat paytida kuchayib borishi, harakatlar amplitudasi keskin kamayishi (90⁰ dan ko‘p) va konservativ davodan ijobiy o‘zgarishlar kuzatilmaganligi. Operativ davo maqsadida"
