  * ^designation[=].value = "For high-tech diagnosis and treatment and cardiac surgery in complicated cases. Also for high-tech diagnosis and surgery in children under 18 with primary uncomplicated and complicated disease."
* #basis-0001-02338 "Agar surunkali yurak yetishmovchiligining II va III bosqichi, funksional sinfi III va IV rivojlangan bo‘lsa, konservativ davo uchun yoki mitral qopqog‘ida barcha kardiojarrohlik amaliyotlari uchun"
