  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Diagnostic coronary angiography and coronary stenting and/or cardiopulmonary bypass and beating-heart cardiac surgery in the presence of comorbid conditions"
* #basis-0001-02363 "Agar surunkali yurak yetishmovchiligining II va III bosqichi, funksional sinfi III va IV rivojlangan bo‘lsa, konservativ davo uchun"
