  * ^designation[=].value = "For surgical intervention (with additional concomitant and/or competing chronic diseases and complications)"
* #basis-0001-02805 "Jarrohlik amaliyotidan keyingi asorat yoki retsidivda jarrohlik amaliyoti uchun. Shuningdek, 18 yoshgacha bo‘lgan bolalarda an’anaviy va yuqori texnologik jarrohlik amaliyotlari uchun"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Для хирургического вмешательства в случае послеоперационных осложнений или рецидивов. Также для традиционных и высокотехнологичных хирургических вмешательств у детей до 18 лет."
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "For surgery in case of postoperative complications or recurrence. Also for conventional and high-tech surgery in children under 18."
* #basis-0001-02806 "Jarrohlik amaliyotidan keyingi asorat yoki retsidivda jarrohlik amaliyoti uchun. Shuningdek, 18 yoshgacha bo‘lgan bolalarda an’anaviy va yuqori texnologik jarrohlik amaliyotlari hamda operatsiyadan keyingi konservativ davo uchun"
